- [ ] **Occupancy Tuning**: Balance block size and resource usage
- [ ] **Bank Conflict Avoidance**: Pad shared memory arrays
- [ ] **Loop Unrolling**: Increase instruction-level parallelism

### Advanced Optimizations (For Final Tuning)
